## Article

```catala
declaration enumeration Situation:
  -- Married content integer
  -- Single

declaration scope A:
  input s content Situation
  input i content optional of integer
  output o1 content integer
  output o2 content integer

scope A:
  definition o1 equals
    match s, i with pattern
    -- Married content n, Present content m : n
    -- Single : 3
    -- anything : 4

  definition o2 equals
    match s, i, s with pattern
    -- Married content n, anything : n
    -- anything : 4
```

